---
import List from "#/components/ui/List.astro";
import Paragraph from "#/components/ui/Paragraph.astro";
import Explainer from "#/components/ui/Explainer.astro";
import Section from "#/components/ui/Section.astro";
import Heading from "#/components/ui/Heading.astro";
import Block from "#/components/ui/Block.astro";
import Badge from "#/components/ui/Badge.astro";
import Message from "#/components/ui/Message.astro";
import Separator from "#/components/ui/Separator.astro";
---

<Section variant="light">
    <div slot="text" class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-333 flex-col gap-3">
        <Heading>
            But what about <em class="text-bubblegum-pink not-italic">privacy?</em>
        </Heading>
        <Paragraph>
            Texts are stripped out of all information except for their content (which is the only thing that this bot
            needs for making memes). This means that usernames and other identifying information is not stored. Saved
            messages are not used for training of AI models or any other purpose rather than to keep the bot functional.
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>
            For GIFs and Images we store their link sources, actual files themselves are never saved to <b>Jstmemit</b> servers.
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>
            By default the bot is turned off in every channel and will only work in the one where you enable it using
            <b>/enable</b>.
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>
            Saved data is automatically deleted after a period of time, however you can always delete yours at any
            moment if you wish to do so using the <b>/settings</b> command
        </Paragraph>

        <List>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap">
                <img
                    class="size-6"
                    src="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/emojis/gif.svg"
                    alt="gif logo icon"
                />
                <h3 class="mb-0.5 text-xl">GIFs: 90 days</h3>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap">
                <img
                    class="size-6"
                    src="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/emojis/chats.svg"
                    alt="texts icon"
                />
                <h3 class="mb-0.5 text-xl">Texts: 30 days</h3>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3 whitespace-nowrap">
                <img
                    class="size-6"
                    src="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/emojis/image.svg"
                    alt="image icon"
                />
                <h3 class="mb-0.5 text-xl">Images: 1 day</h3>
            </li>
        </List>
    </div>
</Section>
